{"t":"MNST","n":"Monster Beverage Corporation","nKo":"몬스터음료","ex":"NasdaqGS","cur":"USD","px":42.43,"chg":-1.26,"chgPct":-0.02884,"prev":43.69,"dayH":43.98,"dayL":42.23,"w52H":50.17,"w52L":35.43,"vol":20070929,"avgVol":10347610,"mcap":83057229824,"pe":38.57,"fpe":32.64,"eps":1.1,"feps":1.3,"pb":8.44,"div":null,"divY":0.0,"beta":0.51,"short":46716705,"shortPct":0.0334,"shortRatio":5.14,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Defensive","sKo":"소비자 방어","i":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","iKo":"음료 - 무알콜","city":"Corona","emp":5773,"web":"https://www.monsterbevcorp.com","sum":"Monster Beverage Corporation, through its subsidiaries, engages in development, marketing, sale, and distribution of energy drink beverages and concentrates in the United States and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Monster Energy Drinks, Strategic Brands, Alcohol Brands, and Other. It offers carbonated non-carbonated energy drinks, ready-to-drink iced teas, lemonades, juice cocktails, single-serve juices and fruit beverages, ready-to-drink dairy and coffee drinks, energy drinks, sports drinks and single-serve still waters, and sodas that are considered natural, sparkling juices, and flavored sparkling beverages. In addition, the company provides its products under the Monster Energy, Monster Energy Ultra, Rehab Monster, Monster Energy Nitro, Java Monster, Punch ","sumKo":"Monster Beverage Corporation은 자회사를 통해 미국 및 해외에서 에너지 드링크 음료 및 농축액의 개발, 마케팅, 판매 및 유통에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 Monster Energy Drinks, 전략적 브랜드, 알코올 브랜드 및 기타의 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 탄산 비탄산 에너지 음료, 즉석 음료 아이스티, 레모네이드, 주스 칵테일, 1회용 주스 및 과일 음료, 즉석 음료 유제품 및 커피 음료, 에너지 음료, 스포츠 음료 및 1회용 정수 물, 천연으로 간주되는 탄산음료, 스파클링 주스 및 향이 첨가된 스파클링 음료를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 Monster Energy, Monster Energy Ultra, Rehab Monster, Monster Energy Nitro, Java Monster, Punch라는 제품을 제공하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":6311050000,"ni":1191624000},{"y":2023,"rev":7140027000,"ni":1630988000},{"y":2024,"rev":7492709000,"ni":1509048000},{"y":2025,"re